nd optimization opportunities for existing Teamcenter and NX integration customizations Knowledge Management and Training Transfer and document gained knowledge regarding Teamcenter and NX integration implementation to internal application teams Conduct training sessions to ensure organizational capability building and knowledge retention Maintain technical documentation and best practice guidelines for team reference &#xa0;

